---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
List threads in date-descending order. Each returned thread includes its constituent message IDs (date-ascending). Filter by account or label; paginate with --limit/--offset

Usage: mxr threads [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>


      --label <LABEL>


      --limit <LIMIT>
          [default: 50]

      --offset <OFFSET>
          [default: 0]

      --sort <SORT>
          Possible values:
          - latest-desc: Latest message first (default)
          - date-asc:    Oldest message first

      --format <FORMAT>
          [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
